  "m_dialogList": {
    "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.ActorDialogList, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
    "m_dialogs": [
      {
        "m_dialogTag": "Prep",
        "m_dialogEntries": [
          {
            "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
            "m_personaName": "WL-BILLA-NPC01_Persona",
            "m_nameOverride": "",
            "m_nameSTKey": null,
            "m_guiDisplay": "",
            "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
            "m_invisible": false,
            "m_requirements": null,
            "m_dialog": "Corruption is a slow thing; it creeps upon you by inches. My dream to share the source of my inspiration became a dream to profit from it.",
            "m_picture": "|_Shared|WorldData|GUI/NpcPortraits/Portrait_Frog_Joan_A_NPC.dds",
            "m_soundFile": "Sound/Dialogue/Joan_Locke_WL-BILLA_055.mp3",
            "m_action": "",
            "m_dialogEvent": "",
            "m_actorTemplateID": 1608167,
            "m_cameraName": ""
          },
          {
            "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
            "m_personaName": "WL-BILLA-NPC01_Persona",
            "m_nameOverride": "",
            "m_nameSTKey": null,
            "m_guiDisplay": "",
            "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
            "m_invisible": false,
            "m_requirements": null,
            "m_dialog": "What would you pay to take a dip in the stuff dreams are literally made on? A lot, it turns out. Even for the placebo effect of our recolored pools.",
            "m_picture": "|_Shared|WorldData|GUI/NpcPortraits/Portrait_Frog_Joan_A_NPC.dds",
            "m_soundFile": "Sound/Dialogue/Joan_Locke_WL-BILLA_056.mp3",
            "m_action": "",
            "m_dialogEvent": "",
            "m_actorTemplateID": 1608167,
            "m_cameraName": ""
          },
          {
            "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
            "m_personaName": "WL-BILLA-NPC01_Persona",
            "m_nameOverride": "",
            "m_nameSTKey": null,
            "m_guiDisplay": "",
            "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
            "m_invisible": false,
            "m_requirements": null,
            "m_dialog": "For Cane it wasn't enough. He wanted the real thing. So stark was his greed, it highlighted my own. So I left and helped the Drovers thwart him.",
            "m_picture": "|_Shared|WorldData|GUI/NpcPortraits/Portrait_Frog_Joan_A_NPC.dds",
            "m_soundFile": "Sound/Dialogue/Joan_Locke_WL-BILLA_057.mp3",
            "m_action": "",
            "m_dialogEvent": "",
            "m_actorTemplateID": 1608167,
            "m_cameraName": ""
          },
          {
            "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
            "m_personaName": "WL-BILLA-NPC01_Persona",
            "m_nameOverride": "",
            "m_nameSTKey": null,
            "m_guiDisplay": "",
            "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
            "m_invisible": false,
            "m_requirements": null,
            "m_dialog": "But if he managed to slant drill beyond the Great Barrier and pump Dream Water straight here... that fool could spark a war. Come on!",
            "m_picture": "|_Shared|WorldData|GUI/NpcPortraits/Portrait_Frog_Joan_A_NPC.dds",
            "m_soundFile": "Sound/Dialogue/Joan_Locke_WL-BILLA_058.mp3",
            "m_action": "",
            "m_dialogEvent": "",
            "m_actorTemplateID": 1608167,
            "m_cameraName": ""
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "m_dialogTag": "Complete",
        "m_dialogEntries": [
          {
            "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
            "m_personaName": "WL-BILLA-NPC01_Persona",
            "m_nameOverride": "",
            "m_nameSTKey": null,
            "m_guiDisplay": "",
            "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
            "m_invisible": false,
            "m_requirements": null,
            "m_dialog": "The Drop Bears still appear to be in full force. Shutting down the Resort's access to the Dreaming didn't help.",
            "m_picture": "|_Shared|WorldData|GUI/NpcPortraits/Portrait_Frog_Joan_A_NPC.dds",
            "m_soundFile": "Sound/Dialogue/Joan_Locke_WL-BILLA_062.mp3",
            "m_action": "",
            "m_dialogEvent": "",
            "m_actorTemplateID": 1608167,
            "m_cameraName": ""
          },
          {
            "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
            "m_personaName": "WL-WOBB-NPC10_Persona",
            "m_nameOverride": "",
            "m_nameSTKey": null,
            "m_guiDisplay": "",
            "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
            "m_invisible": false,
            "m_requirements": null,
            "m_dialog": "No, it wouldn't then, would it? The damage has been done, I'd say. The Townies and their allies corrupted the Dreaming then.",
            "m_picture": "|_Shared|WorldData|GUI/NpcPortraits/Koala_LeaderF_A_NPC.dds",
            "m_soundFile": "Sound/Dialogue/Morp_WL-BILLA_022.mp3",
            "m_action": "",
            "m_dialogEvent": "",
            "m_actorTemplateID": 1594096,
            "m_cameraName": ""
          },
          {
            "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
            "m_personaName": "WL-BILLA-NPC01_Persona",
            "m_nameOverride": "",
            "m_nameSTKey": null,
            "m_guiDisplay": "",
            "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
            "m_invisible": false,
            "m_requirements": null,
            "m_dialog": "Yet it is only the Emu Riders who benefit from these incursions. Or at least tame the beasts that cause them.",
            "m_picture": "|_Shared|WorldData|GUI/NpcPortraits/Portrait_Frog_Joan_A_NPC.dds",
            "m_soundFile": "Sound/Dialogue/Joan_Locke_WL-BILLA_063.mp3",
            "m_action": "",
            "m_dialogEvent": "",
            "m_actorTemplateID": 1608167,
            "m_cameraName": ""
          }
        ]
      }
    ]
